    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in space there is a prison where only the most evil souls go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place goes by only one name....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Titty Space Prison!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now YOU find yourself under the iron rule of the Warden, the lone ruler of the prison. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Condemned to STSP and forced to suffer unimaginable horrors for all of eternity, can you find a way to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STSP: Super Titty Space Prison is an incredibly difficult fast-paced momentum-based platformer with a high skill ceiling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master bunny hopping, wall jumping, and slamming to defeat the prison and your friends! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging single player story mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and Remote play multiplayer VS mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six secret\u00a0collectibles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack </p></li></ul>",
